{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.RefTable\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">RefTable</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A mapping from normalized link labels to a document's reference targets.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.RefTable","kind":"def","line":426,"name":"Lean.Markdown.RefTable","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L426-L429"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.ofString\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">LinkLabel</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofString</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">label</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The normalized form of `label`, for a label that is given as a string.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.ofString","kind":"def","line":422,"name":"Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.ofString","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L422-L424"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.normalizeLabel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalizeLabel</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Lines.html#Lean.Markdown.Lines\">Lines</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes a CommonMark link label (§6.3). `lines` are the label's source lines, and each boundary\nbetween two lines counts as whitespace. Then:\n * Each character is case folded with `caseFold`, which covers ASCII, Latin-1, and Greek.\n * Internal sequences of whitespace become single spaces.\n * Leading and trailing whitespace is removed.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.normalizeLabel","kind":"def","line":396,"name":"Lean.Markdown.normalizeLabel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L396-L420"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprLinkLabel</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Repr.html#Repr\">Repr</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel","kind":"instance","line":394,"name":"Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L394-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel.repr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprLinkLabel</span>.<span class=\"name\">repr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Format/Basic.html#Std.Format\">Format</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel.repr","kind":"def","line":394,"name":"Lean.Markdown.instReprLinkLabel.repr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L394-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instHashableLinkLabel.hash\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">instHashableLinkLabel</span>.<span class=\"name\">hash</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></spa