eq","kind":"def","line":394,"name":"Lean.Markdown.instBEqLinkLabel.beq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L394-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instBEqLinkLabel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">instBEqLinkLabel</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.instBEqLinkLabel","kind":"instance","line":394,"name":"Lean.Markdown.instBEqLinkLabel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L394-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.name\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">LinkLabel</span>.<span class=\"name\">name</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\">LinkLabel</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The label's text after normalization.\n\nNormalization consists of case folding, collapsing internal whitespace to single spaces, and\ntrimming leading and trailing whitespace.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.name","kind":"def","line":393,"name":"Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel.name","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L393-L393"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">LinkLabel</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A normalized link label.\n\nAccording to the CommonMark spec §4.7, link labels are normalized as follows:\n* They are case-folded (though this implementation does not implement full Unicode case folding)\n* Internal whitespace is collapsed to a single space\n* Leading and trailing whitespace are removed\n\nThe constructor is private. Build values via `normalizeLabel`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel","kind":"structure","line":375,"name":"Lean.Markdown.LinkLabel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L375-L394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.plainText\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">plainText</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">inlines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The plain text of inline content, as for an image's `alt` attribute:\n* Markup is dropped\n* Text, escapes, and entities are mapped to their plain text\n* Inline code and math are mapped to their literal content\n* Line breaks are mapped to newlines\n* Autolinks are mapped to their URLs\n* Raw HTML is deleted","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.plainText","kind":"opaque","line":352,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.plainText","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L352-L373"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.extentOf?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">extentOf?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">inlines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The subslice from the start of the first element to the end of the last, if there are any.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.extentOf?","kind":"def","line":346,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.extentOf?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L346-L350"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.extent\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">extent</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The whole inline element, from its first to its last character.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.extent","kind":"def","line":328,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.extent","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L328-L344"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkTarget.title?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">LinkTarget</s