punctuation character (CommonMark §2.4). `backslash` is the\n`\\` and `char` is `X`, which is the text the escape denotes.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.escape","kind":"ctor","line":264,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.escape","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L264-L268"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.softBreak\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">softBreak</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">range</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A soft line break (CommonMark §6.8), which is the line ending between two lines of a paragraph.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.softBreak","kind":"ctor","line":260,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.softBreak","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L260-L263"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.html\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">html</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Lines.html#Lean.Markdown.Lines\">Lines</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Raw HTML (CommonMark §6.6), which is an open or closing tag, a comment, a processing instruction,\na declaration, or a `CDATA` section. The HTML is stored verbatim.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.html","kind":"ctor","line":255,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.html","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L255-L259"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.math\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">math</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">openDollars</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">content</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.MathContent\">MathContent</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">closeDollars</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">display</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"LaTeX math, produced only when the `latexMath` extension is enabled.\n\nThis extension uses `$…$` for inline math and `$$…$$` for display math, with `display` set to\n`true` for the latter.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.math","kind":"ctor","line":247,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.math","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L247-L254"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.autolink\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">autolink</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">openAngle </span><span class=\"fn\">url </span><span class=\"fn\">closeAngle</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">isEmail</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline\">Inline</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"An autolink, which is `<https://...>` or `<scheme:...>` for URI form, or `<user@domain>` for\nemail form (CommonMark §6.5). The URL between the angle brackets is verbatim. Backslash escapes,\ncharacter references, and other Markdown syntax are not processed inside it. `isEmail`\ndistinguishes the email form, whose href gets a `mailto:` prefix when rendered to HTML.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.autolink","kind":"ctor","line":240,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Inline.autolink","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.lean#L240-L246"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.Inline.hardBreak\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Inline</span>.<span class=\"name\">hardBreak</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">marker </span><span class=\"fn\">newline</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class